{% doc %}
  @prompt
    Act as an expert Shopify Frontend, Liquid, and CSS developer. Build a fully responsive custom section that 100% replicates the layout, design language, spacing, and typography of the provided reference image "image_0a22de.jpg".
    
    ### 1. Global Integration, Max Width & Basic Styles
    - **Theme Identity:** The section must automatically inherit the active storefront typography variables (e.g., `var(--font-heading-family)` and `var(--font-body-family)`), page maximum layout width wrappers, and responsive side padding.
    - **Section Layout:** On desktop viewports, split the layout into a clean 2-column horizontal layout (approximately 50% left column for text copy, 50% right column for the timeline tier tracking). On mobile layouts, columns must collapse into a vertical stack with the timeline sliding beneath the copy.
    - **Section Background:** Solid dark-navy background color wash (#061B33 to #0B2240).
    
    ### 2. Left Column Layout (Value Proposition)
    All content elements must be left-aligned and cleanly spaced down the vertical line:
    - **Eyebrow Capsule Tag:** "PRICING & IMPLEMENTATION"
      - Styling: Small, bold, all-caps light-green text inside a rounded pill/capsule background with a very soft, dark transparent green fill.
    - **Main Heading Text:** "Transparent Pricing.\nPredictable Costs."
      - Styling: Large, exceptionally bold, high-contrast white text with clean line breaks.
    - **Paragraph Description:** "Flow is priced as a per-store monthly subscription with a one-time implementation fee. No hidden costs, no usage caps. Every store gets the full platform."
      - Styling: Muted light-gray/blue text with generous line-height to ensure superb readability against the dark background.
    - **Horizontal Value Pillars:** A horizontal row at the bottom containing 3 columns or blocks. Each features:
      - A small, vibrant lime-green circular bullet point dot.
      - **Bold Pillar Title:** Crisp white text (e.g., "Per-store subscription").
      - **Pillar Subtext:** Smaller, muted gray text directly below it (e.g., "Monthly · billed annually").
    
    ### 3. Right Column Layout (Vertical Timeline Tracking Stack)
    A vertical sequence of structured data cards anchored together on the left by a thin vertical accent timeline connector line:
    - **Timeline Connector Details:** A thin, low-contrast vertical rule runs down the left margin of the cards. Along this line, circles or nodes sit exactly perpendicular to each corresponding card.
      - Node 1 (Top): Active status, highlighted with a vibrant lime-green outline circle and a filled solid center dot.
      - Nodes 2 & 3: Inactive status, styled as muted, low-contrast dark gray outline rings.
    - **Layer Tier Cards Styling:** 3 vertically stacked containers with clean rounded corners (border-radius: 12px), an ultra-faint dark border stroke, and an extremely subtle transparent dark-blue card fill wash. Each container contains:
      - **Layer Indicator:** Small, uppercase, low-contrast muted label (e.g., "LAYER 01").
      - **Layer Title:** Crisp, prominent white text.
      - **Features Substring:** A horizontal sequence of sub-features separated by dot dividers (·) in light muted-blue text.
      - **Footer Layout Flex:** A bottom row dividing text cleanly across opposite sides:
        - Left side: Tiny, low-contrast italicized or small metadata text (e.g., "Per store · monthly").
        - Right side: A short, bold uppercase green code badge identifier (e.g., "EPL", "MIL", "HW").
    - **Bottom Timeline Ending Capsule:** Positioned directly below the final layer card, anchored perfectly to the timeline path. A dark, pill-shaped capsule container containing a small green indicator dot and green action text tracking rightwards.
    
    ### 4. Exact Content Mapping for 100% Replication
    Ensure all text blocks map exactly to this English copy verbatim from image_0a22de.jpg:
    
    #### LEFT SIDE VALUE PILLARS:
    - Pillar 1: Title: "Per-store subscription" | Subtext: "Monthly · billed annually"
    - Pillar 2: Title: "One-time setup fee" | Subtext: "Hardware Included"
    - Pillar 3: Title: "Volume discounts" | Subtext: "From 10 stores"
    
    #### RIGHT SIDE TIMELINE TIERS:
    - **Card 1 (LAYER 01):**
      - Title: Platform Subscription
      - Features: Full analytics · Decision layer · Mobile ops · API
      - Footer Details: "Per store · monthly" | Right Badge: EPL
    - **Card 2 (LAYER 02):**
      - Title: Implementation Fee
      - Features: Hardware · Install · Config · Training
      - Footer Details: "One-time · per store" | Right Badge: MIL
    - **Card 3 (LAYER 03):**
      - Title: Hardware (when needed)
      - Features: Ceiling-mount AI cameras · Edge devices
      - Footer Details: "Included in impl. fee" | Right Badge: HW
    - **Bottom Capsule Label:** Live store data → structured action
    
    ### 5. Shopify Architecture & Schema Requirements
    - Map all titles, paragraphs, tier items, metadata descriptors, badges, and background color choices to block settings within the Liquid schema settings to make the entire layout 100% customizable in the Shopify Theme Customizer.
    - All custom component styles m
{% enddoc %}
{% assign ai_gen_id = block.id | replace: '_', '' | downcase %}

{% style %}
  .ai-pricing-section-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    display: block;
    width: 100%;
    background: linear-gradient(180deg, {{ block.settings.background_color_start }} 0%, {{ block.settings.background_color_end }} 100%);
    padding: {{ block.settings.section_padding_mobile }}px 0;
  }

  @media screen and (min-width: 750px) {
    .ai-pricing-section-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      padding: {{ block.settings.section_padding_desktop }}px 0;
    }
  }

  .ai-pricing-container-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    max-width: {{ settings.page_width }}px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    padding: 0 var(--spacing-6);
  }

  @media screen and (min-width: 1000px) {
    .ai-pricing-container-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      padding: 0 var(--spacing-8);
    }
  }

  .ai-pricing-grid-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    gap: {{ block.settings.column_gap_mobile }}px;
  }

  @media screen and (min-width: 1000px) {
    .ai-pricing-grid-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
      gap: {{ block.settings.column_gap_desktop }}px;
      align-items: start;
    }
  }

  .ai-pricing-left-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: {{ block.settings.left_content_gap }}px;
  }

  .ai-pricing-eyebrow-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    padding: {{ block.settings.eyebrow_padding_vertical }}px {{ block.settings.eyebrow_padding_horizontal }}px;
    background-color: {{ block.settings.eyebrow_background }};
    border-radius: {{ block.settings.eyebrow_border_radius }}px;
    width: fit-content;
  }

  .ai-pricing-eyebrow-text-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    font-family: var(--font-heading-family);
    font-size: {{ block.settings.eyebrow_font_size }}px;
    font-weight: 700;
    letter-spacing: 0.05em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: {{ block.settings.eyebrow_text_color }};
    margin: 0;
  }

  .ai-pricing-heading-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    font-family: var(--font-heading-family);
    font-size: {{ block.settings.heading_font_size_mobile }}px;
    font-weight: 800;
    line-height: 1.1;
    color: {{ block.settings.heading_color }};
    margin: 0;
    white-space: pre-line;
  }

  @media screen and (min-width: 750px) {
    .ai-pricing-heading-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      font-size: {{ block.settings.heading_font_size_desktop }}px;
    }
  }

  .ai-pricing-description-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    font-family: var(--font-body-family);
    font-size: {{ block.settings.description_font_size_mobile }}px;
    line-height: 1.6;
    color: {{ block.settings.description_color }};
    margin: 0;
  }

  @media screen and (min-width: 750px) {
    .ai-pricing-description-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      font-size: {{ block.settings.description_font_size_desktop }}px;
    }
  }

  .ai-pricing-pillars-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    gap: {{ block.settings.pillars_gap }}px;
    margin-top: {{ block.settings.pillars_margin_top }}px;
  }

  @media screen and (min-width: 750px) {
    .ai-pricing-pillars-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
    }
  }

  .ai-pricing-pillar-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    display: flex;
    align-items: flex-start;
    gap: {{ block.settings.pillar_dot_gap }}px;
  }

  .ai-pricing-pillar-dot-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    width: {{ block.settings.pillar_dot_size }}px;
    height: {{ block.settings.pillar_dot_size }}px;
    border-radius: 50%;
    background-color: {{ block.settings.pillar_dot_color }};
    flex-shrink: 0;
    margin-top: 6px;
  }

  .ai-pricing-pillar-content-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 4px;
  }

  .ai-pricing-pillar-title-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    font-family: var(--font-heading-family);
    font-size: {{ block.settings.pillar_title_font_size }}px;
    font-weight: 600;
    color: {{ block.settings.pillar_title_color }};
    margin: 0;
  }

  .ai-pricing-pillar-subtitle-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    font-family: var(--font-body-family);
    font-size: {{ block.settings.pillar_subtitle_font_size }}px;
    color: {{ block.settings.pillar_subtitle_color }};
    margin: 0;
  }

  .ai-pricing-right-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    position: relative;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
  }

  .ai-pricing-timeline-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    position: relative;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: {{ block.settings.timeline_card_gap }}px;
  }

  .ai-pricing-timeline-line-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    position: absolute;
    left: {{ block.settings.timeline_line_offset }}px;
    top: {{ block.settings.timeline_node_size | divided_by: 2 }}px;
    width: {{ block.settings.timeline_line_width }}px;
    height: calc(100% - {{ block.settings.timeline_node_size }}px);
    background-color: {{ block.settings.timeline_line_color }};
  }

  .ai-pricing-tier-wrapper-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    position: relative;
    display: flex;
    align-items: flex-start;
    gap: {{ block.settings.timeline_card_offset }}px;
  }

  .ai-pricing-timeline-node-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    position: relative;
    width: {{ block.settings.timeline_node_size }}px;
    height: {{ block.settings.timeline_node_size }}px;
    border-radius: 50%;
    flex-shrink: 0;
    z-index: 2;
    background-color: {{ block.settings.background_color_start }};
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
  }

  .ai-pricing-timeline-node-{{ ai_gen_id }}::before {
    content: '';
    width: {{ block.settings.timeline_node_inner_size }}px;
    height: {{ block.settings.timeline_node_inner_size }}px;
    border-radius: 50%;
    background-color: transparent;
  }

  .ai-pricing-timeline-node-{{ ai_gen_id }}.active {
    border: {{ block.settings.timeline_node_border_width }}px solid {{ block.settings.timeline_node_active_color }};
  }

  .ai-pricing-timeline-node-{{ ai_gen_id }}.active::before {
    background-color: {{ block.settings.timeline_node_active_color }};
  }

  .ai-pricing-timeline-node-{{ ai_gen_id }}.inactive {
    border: {{ block.settings.timeline_node_border_width }}px solid {{ block.settings.timeline_node_inactive_color }};
  }

  .ai-pricing-tier-card-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    flex: 1;
    background-color: {{ block.settings.card_background }};
    border: {{ block.settings.card_border_width }}px solid {{ block.settings.card_border_color }};
    border-radius: {{ block.settings.card_border_radius }}px;
    padding: {{ block.settings.card_padding }}px;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: {{ block.settings.card_content_gap }}px;
  }

  .ai-pricing-tier-label-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    font-family: var(--font-body-family);
    font-size: {{ block.settings.tier_label_font_size }}px;
    font-weight: 600;
    letter-spacing: 0.08em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: {{ block.settings.tier_label_color }};
    margin: 0;
  }

  .ai-pricing-tier-title-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    font-family: var(--font-heading-family);
    font-size: {{ block.settings.tier_title_font_size }}px;
    font-weight: 600;
    color: {{ block.settings.tier_title_color }};
    margin: 0;
  }

  .ai-pricing-tier-features-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    font-family: var(--font-body-family);
    font-size: {{ block.settings.tier_features_font_size }}px;
    color: {{ block.settings.tier_features_color }};
    margin: 0;
  }

  .ai-pricing-tier-footer-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: space-between;
    align-items: center;
    margin-top: auto;
    padding-top: {{ block.settings.card_footer_padding_top }}px;
  }

  .ai-pricing-tier-meta-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    font-family: var(--font-body-family);
    font-size: {{ block.settings.tier_meta_font_size }}px;
    font-style: italic;
    color: {{ block.settings.tier_meta_color }};
    margin: 0;
  }

  .ai-pricing-tier-badge-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    font-family: var(--font-heading-family);
    font-size: {{ block.settings.tier_badge_font_size }}px;
    font-weight: 700;
    letter-spacing: 0.05em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: {{ block.settings.tier_badge_color }};
    margin: 0;
  }

  .ai-pricing-timeline-end-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    position: relative;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: {{ block.settings.timeline_card_offset }}px;
    margin-top: {{ block.settings.timeline_end_margin_top }}px;
  }

  .ai-pricing-timeline-end-spacer-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    width: {{ block.settings.timeline_node_size }}px;
    flex-shrink: 0;
  }

  .ai-pricing-end-capsule-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: {{ block.settings.end_capsule_gap }}px;
    padding: {{ block.settings.end_capsule_padding_vertical }}px {{ block.settings.end_capsule_padding_horizontal }}px;
    background-color: {{ block.settings.end_capsule_background }};
    border-radius: {{ block.settings.end_capsule_border_radius }}px;
    width: fit-content;
  }

  .ai-pricing-end-dot-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    width: {{ block.settings.end_capsule_dot_size }}px;
    height: {{ block.settings.end_capsule_dot_size }}px;
    border-radius: 50%;
    background-color: {{ block.settings.end_capsule_dot_color }};
    flex-shrink: 0;
  }

  .ai-pricing-end-text-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    font-family: var(--font-body-family);
    font-size: {{ block.settings.end_capsule_font_size }}px;
    font-weight: 500;
    color: {{ block.settings.end_capsule_text_color }};
    margin: 0;
  }
{% endstyle %}

